WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.940
Jakarta, Lagos, Leeds.

2
00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:07.350
In each city, Muslims pray
using the same Arabic words.

3
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.890
Many who say them don't speak Arabic.

4
00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.990
Some still learn the whole
Qur'an by heart, every word.

5
00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:16.480
English translations are easy to find.

6
00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:19.740
Yet in prayer, a
translation is never used.

7
00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:22.780
So why recite in Arabic,
if you don't speak it?

8
00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:25.830
In this mission, you'll
see how Muslims recite it,

9
00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:27.900
with careful rules of sound.

10
00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:30.910
Then you'll follow it through
a Muslim's life and year,

11
00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:33.460
from weddings to the nights of Ramadan.

12
00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:38.020
Your mission: find out why Muslims
everywhere recite it in Arabic,

13
00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:39.470
understood or not.
